# Build context is scripts/dev/gh-runner/ (per compose.yml `context: .`).
# Only Dockerfile + entrypoint.sh need to be readable during build; the
# rest is either dev-side scripts or local-only files that shouldn't
# leak into the image or invalidate its build cache.

# Everything by default, then whitelist what the build actually needs.
*

# What the Dockerfile actually references (via COPY / build ARGs).
!Dockerfile
!entrypoint.sh
